<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-ZIMBABWE BEAT TANZANIA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZIMBABWE BEAT TANZANIA.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat Tanzania 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly international at the National Sports Stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Claudius Zviripayi (3rd minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000.</p>
